sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Browser
    participant View as Django View
    participant Form as NoteForm
    participant Model as Note Model
    participant DB as SQLite Database

    User->>Browser: Submit new note
    Browser->>View: POST /notes/new/
    View->>Form: Validate submitted data
    Form-->>View: Valid form
    View->>Model: Save note
    Model->>DB: INSERT note
    DB-->>Model: Saved note
    Model-->>View: Note instance
    View-->>Browser: Redirect to note detail
    Browser->>View: GET /notes/{id}/
    View->>Model: Find note by primary key
    Model->>DB: SELECT note
    DB-->>Model: Note record
    View-->>Browser: Render note detail page
